<section class="section section-soft plans-page-content"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading centered"><span class="eyebrow">PLANOS ASSISTENCIAIS</span><h2>Cuidado pensado para cada necessidade.</h2><p>Solicite um atendimento personalizado para conhecer preços, carências, dependentes e cobertura contratual.</p></div><div class="plan-grid"><?php foreach (plans() as $index => $plan): ?><article class="plan-card <?= !empty($plan['featured']) ? 'featured' : '' ?>"><span class="plan-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="bi bi-shield-heart"></i></span><p class="plan-tag"><?= e($plan['tag']) ?></p><h3>Plano <?= e($plan['name']) ?></h3><?php if (!empty($plan['description'])): ?><p class="plan-description"><?= e($plan['description']) ?></p><?php endif; ?><?php $priceText = (string)($plan['price_label'] ?? 'Valores sob consulta'); $hasNumericPrice = preg_match('/^\\s*R\\$\\s*([0-9][0-9.]*,[0-9]{2})(.*)$/u', $priceText, $priceParts) === 1; ?>
          <div class="price-note plan-price-highlight" aria-label="Valor: <?= e($priceText) ?>">
